{"id":"vod_jy_32674","vodId":"32674","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"火影忍者","name_cn":"火影忍者","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第220集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/77535d1e9929af6f74ed1bc5f7efc374.jpg"},"summary":"十多年前一只拥有巨大威力的妖兽“九尾妖狐”袭击了木叶忍者村，当时的第四代火影拼尽全力，以自己的生命为代价将“九尾妖狐”封印在了刚出生的鸣人身上。木叶村终于恢复了平静，但村民们却把鸣人当成像“九尾妖狐”那样的怪物看待，所有人都疏远他。鸣人自小就孤苦无依，一晃十多年过去了，少年鸣人考入了木叶村的忍者学校，结识了好朋友佐助和小樱。佐助是宇智波家族的传人之一，当他还是小孩的时候他的哥哥——一个已经拥有高超忍术的忍者将他们家族的人都杀死了，然后投靠了一直想将木叶村毁灭的大蛇丸，佐助自小就发誓要超越哥哥，为家族报仇。鸣人他们在忍者学校得到了教官卡卡西的精心指点，在他的帮助下去迎接成长中的一次又一次挑战！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-04-29 21:04:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":220,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第001集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axGB6ne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第002集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dBg2rne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第003集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJZ28ld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第004集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dNx2OKa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第005集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRg0l0e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第006集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QbY6n79d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第007集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3lp6na/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第008集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe76w9Gd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第009集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg5Gplb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第010集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmwnqAe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第011集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqjrlRd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第012集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axGB2ne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第013集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dBg2Pne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第014集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJZ2Nld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第015集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dNx2YKa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第016集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRg0P0e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第017集","url":